```

### 5. Bonus: Auto-completion (optional but awesome)

Add this to your `.bashrc`:

```bash
_bd_completions() {
  COMPREPLY=($(jq -r 'include "collection"; $collection | keys[]' lib/collection.jq | grep "^${COMP_WORDS[1]}"))
}
complete -F _bd_completions bd
```

Now you get tab-completion of all 200+ Black Duck endpoints.

